{"ranking_testcase_count":null,"judge_revision":0,"judge_baseline_verified":false,"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a1d","ID":2328,"contest_id":"6a9e2d04bf41025d60f21804","user_id":"69ca5c5836edf569534aff34","name":"padv3grad","canonical_name":"padv3grad","version_no":1,"version_label":"v1","title":"PadV3Grad","desc":"#### **赛题概述**\r\n参考昇腾版本内置PadV3Grad算子的 TBE 实现，在昇腾 NPU 上基于 Ascend C 编程语言实现功能一致的算子, 完成算子设计、开发、测试全流程工作。\r\n##### **功能实现要求**\r\n与原 TBE 算子核心功能完全对齐，支持原算子对应的所有数据类型、数据格式，并且比较方式从二进制比较改为逻辑值比较。\r\n必须实现算子泛化功能，满足各类合法输入场景的计算需求。\r\n##### **测试标准**\r\n需参考内置 TBE 算子自行设计全场景自验证用例，测试阶段将采用泛化数据进行功能、精度、性能全维度验证，所有测试用例执行通过。\r\n##### **精度要求**\r\n算子计算精度需满足 CANN Judge平台对应题目精度默认阈值（float : 1e-4, half : 1e-3, int类型:0）。\r\n##### **问题答疑**\r\n相关技术问题请到对应开源仓提交issue：[https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/issues)","code_template":"gitcode_template_noopapi","cann_version":"9.1.0","create_time":"2026-10-22T06:20:48.56Z","start_time":"2026-11-01T16:00:00Z","end_time":"2026-12-28T15:59:00Z","score_mode":1,"use_baseline":false,"enable_cannlab":false,"iterations":5,"difficulty":3,"tags":["ict"],"testcases":[{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a22","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19312}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a27","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19313}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a2b","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19314}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a2f","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19315}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a33","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19316}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a37","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19317}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a3b","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19318}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a3f","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19319}},{"testcase_id":{"_id":"6ad9ab403ff2fef7e80e2a43","type":"default","baseline":null,"ID":19320}},{"testcase_id":{"_id"